1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,161
Fermentation stops near fourteen percent alcohol, because zymase is destroyed by the ethanol it makes.

2
00:00:07,161 --> 00:00:11,757
That is how jaand and chhyang are made from millet and rice in the hills.

3
00:00:11,757 --> 00:00:14,361
Distil the wash, and you get raksi.

